        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721930/extras/51bf765fc9fdce5d4e73c3047c9529d8.avif?t=1761367542\" width=616 height=72 /></span>Kouta has always been compared to his older brother, Shouma. Not only is Shouma the ace pitcher of the baseball club, he's also smart and an all-around great person. Always having felt like he just can't compete, Kouta has harbored an inferiority complex towards his brother for as long as he can remember. However, even as he wallows in the gloom of living in the shadow of his brother, Yuuna, Kouta’s childhood friend and crush, never fails to brighten his day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kouta fantasizes day and night about being together with Yuuna, but he's held back from confessing his feelings by dreary thoughts brought on by years of being number two to his brother. That is, until one day when he actually finds out she's dating Shouma and has been for a while. After being hit in the face with the cruel truth, something shatters inside Kouta. He decides to commit the ultimate betrayal... Stealing Yuuna away from Shouma by winning her over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721930/extras/1bd360a10904a4c41c7b2e295ceb9fb2.avif?t=1761367542\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping story of love and betrayal awaits you in this visual novel. Every line of text will have you on the edge of your seat as Kouta does whatever it takes to make Yuuna his. After all, sometimes you have to be prepared to lose it all to get what you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721930/extras/23ecfc52344ac752fedc30d0de12b3c8.avif?t=1761367542\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721930/extras/1fe2e456bfe7b81c24fb64dcdeb0a6dc.avif?t=1761367542\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721930/extras/a619403304aee85f483494f76053fa60.avif?t=1761367542\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721930/extras/b6d08bf29613c9e486d78f863ec7ef4f.avif?t=1761367542\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Step Into Another's Shoes</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the world from Kouta's perspective as you advance through the narrative. Will he succeed in his desperate quest or will Yuuna's love for Shouma prevail?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721930/extras/51bf765fc9fdce5d4e73c3047c9529d8.avif?t=1761367542\" width=616 height=72 /></span>Kouta has always been compared to his older brother, Shouma. Not only is Shouma the ace pitcher of the baseball club, he's also smart and an all-around great person. Always having felt like he just can't compete, Kouta has harbored an inferiority complex towards his brother for as long as he can remember. However, even as he wallows in the gloom of living in the shadow of his brother, Yuuna, Kouta’s childhood friend and crush, never fails to brighten his day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kouta fantasizes day and night about being together with Yuuna, but he's held back from confessing his feelings by dreary thoughts brought on by years of being number two to his brother. That is, until one day when he actually finds out she's dating Shouma and has been for a while. After being hit in the face with the cruel truth, something shatters inside Kouta. He decides to commit the ultimate betrayal... Stealing Yuuna away from Shouma by winning her over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721930/extras/1bd360a10904a4c41c7b2e295ceb9fb2.avif?t=1761367542\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping story of love and betrayal awaits you in this visual novel. Every line of text will have you on the edge of your seat as Kouta does whatever it takes to make Yuuna his. After all, sometimes you have to be prepared to lose it all to get what you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721930/extras/23ecfc52344ac752fedc30d0de12b3c8.avif?t=1761367542\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721930/extras/1fe2e456bfe7b81c24fb64dcdeb0a6dc.avif?t=1761367542\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721930/extras/a619403304aee85f483494f76053fa60.avif?t=1761367542\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721930/extras/b6d08bf29613c9e486d78f863ec7ef4f.avif?t=1761367542\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Step Into Another's Shoes</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the world from Kouta's perspective as you advance through the narrative. Will he succeed in his desperate quest or will Yuuna's love for Shouma prevail?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
